SUMMARY:Empty Bowls Houston at The Market at River Oaks District
DESCRIPTION:Empty Bowls Houston will be at the The Market at River Oaks District\nSunday\, August 23 from 11 am to 3 pm at River Oaks District\, 4444 Westheimer\, 77027\nHappy summer\, friends! Empty Bowls Houston is happy to announce that we will be “popping up” at one of Houston’s newest farmers markets\, The Market at River Oaks District! We will have a selection of bowls for sale and a live pottery demo on the potters’ wheel. Come shop for farm-fresh goodies and other local food products and\, of course\, our amazing bowls made by local artists to benefit Houston Food Bank!
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/empty-bowls-houston-at-the-market-in-river-oaks/
LOCATION:The Market at River Oaks\, 4444 Westheimer\, Houston\, TX\, 77027\, United States
CATEGORIES:Empty Bowls,FEATURED,Special Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/EB-TheMarket-1200x900-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
