SUMMARY:National Food Bank Day
DESCRIPTION:September 4th is National Food Bank Day – a day dedicated to highlighting the vital work food banks do across our nation to support those in need. Food insecurity is a rising issue in our country\, but together we can change that. Join the movement by volunteering\, donating\, or advocating for food security.
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/national-food-bank-day/
CATEGORIES:FEATURED,Hunger Action Month
