SUMMARY:National Voter Registration Day
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that on Tuesday\, September 15th\, it’s National Voter Registration Day! \nAt Houston Food Bank\, we care about having your voice heard\, and we are proud to provide the opportunity for you to register to vote on National Voter Registration Day! \nWe are partnering with Harris County Tax Office and the National Voter Registration Day organization to serve as a site for Voter Registration at our Portwall location. \nYou are eligible to register to vote if: \n\nYou are a United States citizen;\nYou are a resident of the county where you submit the application;\nYou are at least 17 years and 10 months old on the date your voter registration application is submitted\, and you are 18 years of age on Election Day.\nYou are not a convicted felon (you may be eligible to vote if you have completed your sentence\, probation\, and parole); and\nYou have not been declared by a court exercising probate jurisdiction to be either totally mentally incapacitated or partially mentally incapacitated without the right to vote.\n\nLearn More
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/national-voter-registration-day-3/
LOCATION:Houston Food Bank East Branch\, 535 Portwall Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77029\, United States
CATEGORIES:FEATURED,Hunger Action Month,Voter Registration
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/NVRD-2026-1200x900-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
