SUMMARY:Hunger Action Day
DESCRIPTION:September 29th is Hunger Action Day. \nTo mark the occasion\, you can make a contribution to Houston Food Bank’s efforts to alleviate hunger\, learn how your voice can make a difference to those experiencing food insecurity\, or even give your time to help your neighbors in need. \nTogether we can work towards a world without food insecurity.
